\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2   But tensions between Han Chinese and Uyghurs grew. Eventually Nancy, frustrated by the lack of good jobs even for educated Uyghurs in China, took a position in Turkey. That didn't raise eyebrows at the time, but after China began its crackdown in 2016, any foreign travel by Uyghurs became suspicious.}
